      "id": 3,
      "objective": "Research standard vacuum chamber vendors (Lesker, Ideal Vacuum, MDC, Nor-Cal, LewVac) and pricing for chambers near 312x222x140mm",
      "rationale": "Need to evaluate if off-the-shelf vacuum chambers could replace the custom frame",
      "status": "pending",
